Thanks for the medicine. I'm sorry to trouble you for it.

6
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:25,240
Has your grandfather's condition improved recently?

7
00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:28,960
There hasn't been much change. He mostly stays in his bed.

8
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:32,940
Even though I've finally figured out a way for us to reclaim Saga.

9
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:36,200
You seem to have plenty of comrades on your side now.

10
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:40,160
Yes, I do. And as a matter of fact, we've all been putting together a petition.

11
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:44,680
See? Look at it. We're taking this straight to the prefectural magistrate.

12
00:00:45,160 --> 00:00:48,400
We're also going to talk to as many of the elders around here as possible.

13
00:00:50,260 --> 00:00:52,600
I'm sure that'll make a sizable difference.

14
00:00:52,680 --> 00:00:52,980
Right?

15
00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:56,240
